  "implementation_contract": [
    "BindingDepth remains default16/max32 per definition, named dependency path50, runtime domain nesting16, existing node/work/byte limits remain independent.",
    "Active read and domain counters belong to operation-shared DiscoveryState, including fresh execution-stage runtimes. Direct crosstabs count once; already-counted named read path does not count twice.",
    "The128 engineering active-interpreter budget combines active reads, normalized suspended named-definition syntax and current definition syntax. It is not a native Access or raw Rust-stack-frame count.",
    "Every entered read/domain/named scope restores counters, lexical owner and parameter scope on Result errors. Identical sequential/different-criteria/volatile invocations are not treated as dependency cycles.",
    "Recursive frames retain source-expansion state; nonrecursive helpers own physical-schema, projection, UNION completion and domain parse/finish scratch. Existing eager ordering, scalar carriers, prefix DISTINCT/UNION semantics, metadata-only binding and source namespaces remain unchanged."
  ],
